@title Yggdra Union - We'll Never Fight Alone (USA)
@file Yggdra Union - We'll Never Fight Alone (U).gba
@game BYUE
@chip EEPROM 64Kbit
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: the first save comes after the first battle (Thieves' Stronghold, Chapter 1); the script stops at the battle's first move. Attacking the thieves was not worked out in the live session (with the tutorials off: moving next to one, START for Union, A and START on the Union screen, a direction into the enemy all left the battle unstarted). The 8 KB EEPROM written here holds 32 bytes from the boot.

# Health warning, START through the intro twice, title > NEW GAME,
# tutorials No, the prologue text, Chapter 1, A through the thieves' talk,
# CARD SELECT: all five cards (Steal, Mind Change, Refresh, Mirage,
# Rockfall), START > character, START > "Ready for combat?" A, the battle
# map at Thieves' Stronghold with Milanor in move mode, two steps down next
# to the thieves.

[new]
wait 600
checkpoint warning window=30
press A
wait 300
wait 300
press START
wait 180
press START
wait 180
wait 240
wait 180
checkpoint title window=30
press A
wait 240
checkpoint tutorial_prompt window=30 compare=text
press DOWN
wait 20
press A
wait 240
checkpoint prologue window=30
tap A times=20 every=30 hold=4
tap A times=40 every=30 hold=4
press START
wait 120
tap A times=20 every=60 hold=4
checkpoint chapter1 window=30
tap A times=30 every=30 hold=4
tap A times=30 every=40 hold=4
tap A times=30 every=40 hold=4
tap A times=40 every=30 hold=4
tap A times=60 every=20 hold=4
tap A times=15 every=30 hold=4
tap A times=40 every=30 hold=4
checkpoint card_select window=30
press A
wait 60
press DOWN
wait 20
press A
wait 60
press DOWN
wait 20
press A
wait 60
press RIGHT
wait 20
press DOWN
wait 15
press DOWN
wait 15
press A
wait 40
press DOWN
wait 20
press A
wait 40
press DOWN
wait 20
press RIGHT
wait 20
press A
wait 40
press DOWN
wait 20
press A
wait 40
press DOWN
wait 20
press DOWN
wait 20
press LEFT
wait 20
press A
wait 60
press START
wait 90
press START
wait 120
checkpoint ready_for_combat window=30
press A
wait 180
tap A times=20 every=30 hold=4
checkpoint battle_map window=30
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 40
press DOWN
wait 20
press DOWN
wait 20
wait 10
checkpoint milanor_moved window=30

